li_ming  ](/direct/li_ming)\\n\\n<::after>\\n\\nNovember 11, 2025 \\n\\n<::after>\\n\\ntheagentcompany \\n\\nAdmin \\n\\n12:39 PM \\n\\nHi Li Ming! I need to create a job description for a new grad software engineer position. Could you please provide me with: 1) The location of the job description template file, 2) The minimum and preferred qualifications, and 3) The salary range for this position? \\n\\nli_ming  12:39 PM \\n\\nHi, the job description template is located on your local machine under the /instruction directory with the file name [ template.md. ](//template.md. \"//template.md.\") For the minimum qualifications: first, the candidate should have graduated less than 12 months ago or be about to complete a Bachelor\u2019s or Master\u2019s Degree in Computer Science, Computer Engineering, or a related field; second, they should have programming experience in one or more languages; third, knowledge of CS fundamentals like OOP, algorithms, data structures, and problem solving; and fourth, some hands-on experience with data structures or algorithms through coursework, projects, internships, or research. Preferred qualifications include: prior technical internship(s), experience with distributed systems, multi-tiered systems, algorithms, or relational databases, and the ability to tackle ambiguous problems with abstract thinking. The salary range for this position is $120,000 to $150,000 USD. \\n\\n\\n\\n\\n[ \\\\\\\\[KaTeX\\\\\\\\] ](https://khan.github.io/KaTeX/function-support.html)\\n', url='http://the-agent-company.com:3000/direct/7My8YbErQi3E7vd35CZYWHd5bCmhj5YcFe', trigger_by_action='browse_interactive', screenshot_path='/outputs/.browser_screenshots/screenshot_20251111_123957_643848.png', error=False, observation=<ObservationType.BROWSE: 'browse'>, goal_image_urls=[], open_pages_urls=['http://the-agent-company.com:3000/direct/7My8YbErQi3E7vd35CZYWHd5bCmhj5YcFe'], active_page_index=0, last_browser_action=\"\\n\\n\\n\\nfill('1939', 'Hi Li Ming! I need to create a job description for a new grad software engineer position. Could you please provide me with: 1) The location of the job description template file, 2) The minimum and preferred qualifications, and 3) The salary range for this position?')\\nnoop(1000)  # Wait for message to be typed\\npress('1939', 'Enter')  # Send the message\\nnoop(3000)  # Wait for response\\n\\n\\n\\n\", last_browser_action_error='', focused_element_bid='1939'), FileReadAction(path='/instruction/template.md', start=0, end=-1, thought='Perfect! Li Ming has responded with all the information I need. Now I have:\\n\\n1. **From Zhang Wei**: Key job responsibilities (5 items)\\n2. **From Li Ming**: \\n   - Template location: `/instruction/template.md`\\n   - Minimum qualifications (4 items)\\n   - Preferred qualifications (3 items) \\n   - Salary range: $120,000 to $150,000 USD\\n\\nLet me first check the template file to understand the structure:', action=<ActionType.READ: 'read'>, security_risk=None, impl_source='oh_aci', view_range=None), FileReadObservation(content=\"Here's the result of running `cat -n` on /instruction/template.md:\\n     1\\t# Software Development Engineer - New Grads\\n     2\\t\\n     3\\tThe Agent Company is an innovative software firm specializing in distributed systems, database technologies, \\n     4\\tand artificial intelligence. Our core business includes developing and maintaining high-performance distributed graph databases, \\n     5\\tstreaming databases, and providing advanced AI solutions.\\n     6\\t\\n     7\\tAt The Agent Company, we hire the best minds in technology to innovate and build on behalf of our customers. Our Software Development Engineers (SDEs) use cutting-edge technology to solve complex problems and get to see the impact of their work first-hand. The challenges SDEs solve for at The Agent Company are big and impact millions of customers, sellers, and products around the world. With a dedicated mentor and supportive team, you'll onboard quickly and start contributing to impactful projects soon after starting here at The Agent Company!\\n     8\\t\\n     9\\t## Key Responsibilities: \\n    10\\t[Insert Information]\\n    11\\t\\n    12\\t## Minimum Requirement:\\n    13\\t[Insert Information]\\n    14\\t\\n    15\\t## Preferred Qualification:\\n    16\\t[Insert Information]\\n    17\\t\\n    18\\tWe are hiring Software Engineer - New Grads across multiple offices. Please apply for the single location that you're the most interested in, and we will discuss more with you as you move through the process. We can only consider one application in 30 days. \\n    19\\t\\n    20\\t## Company Vision\\n    21\\tTo become a global leader in distributed systems and artificial intelligence, solving complex data processing and analysis challenges through innovative technologies.\\n    22\\t\\n    23\\t## Company Mission\\n    24\\tTo provide businesses and developers with the most advanced, efficient, and user-friendly data processing and AI tools, driving technological innovation and maximizing the value of data.\\n    25\\t\\n    26\\t## Salary Range\\n    27\\t[Insert Information]\\n    28\\t\\n    29\\t## Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion\\n    30\\t\\n    31\\tAt The Agent Company, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at The Agent Company are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.\\n\", path='/instruction/template.md', observation=<ObservationType.READ: 'read'>, impl_source='oh_aci'), **FileEditAction**\nPath: [/workspace/job_description.md]\nThought: Now I'll create the job description file by combining all the information I received from Zhang Wei and Li Ming, following the template structure:\nCommand: create\nCreated File with Text:\n```\n# Software Development Engineer - New Grads\n\nThe Agent Company is an innovative software firm specializing in distributed systems, database technologies, \nand artificial intelligence. Our core business includes developing and maintaining high-performance distributed graph databases, \nstreaming databases, and providing advanced AI solutions.\n\nAt The Agent Company, we hire the best minds in technology to innovate and build on behalf of our customers. Our Software Development Engineers (SDEs) use cutting-edge technology to solve complex problems and get to see the impact of their work first-hand. The challenges SDEs solve for at The Agent Company are big and impact millions of customers, sellers, and products around the world. With a dedicated mentor and supportive team, you'll onboard quickly and start contributing to impactful projects soon after starting here at The Agent Company!\n\n## Key Responsibilities: \n- Work with a team to develop and extend The Agent Company's product\n- Design and build innovative technologies in a large distributed computing environment and help lead fundamental changes in the industry\n- Create solutions to run predictions on distributed systems with exposure to innovative technologies at incredible scale and speed\n- Own full software development lifecycle: design, development, testing, and operating in production\n- Build solutions with a high level of reliability, scalability, and security\n\n## Minimum Requirement:\n- Graduated less than 12 months ago or about to complete a Bachelor's or Master's Degree in Computer Science, Computer Engineering, or a related field\n- Programming experience in one or more languages\n- Knowledge of CS fundamentals like OOP, algorithms, data structures, and problem solving\n- Some hands-on experience with data structures or algorithms through coursework, projects, internships, or research\n\n## Preferred Qualification:\n- Prior technical internship(s)\n- Experience with distributed systems, multi-tiered systems, algorithms, or relational databases\n- Ability to tackle ambiguous problems with abstract thinking\n\nWe are hiring Software Engineer - New Grads across multiple offices. Please apply for the single location that you're the most interested in, and we will discuss more with you as you move through the process. We can only consider one application in 30 days. \n\n## Company Vision\nTo become a global leader in distributed systems and artificial intelligence, solving complex data processing and analysis challenges through innovative technologies.\n\n## Company Mission\nTo provide businesses and developers with the most advanced, efficient, and user-friendly data processing and AI tools, driving technological innovation and maximizing the value of data.\n\n## Salary Range\n$120,000 to $150,000 USD\n\n## Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion\n\nAt The Agent Company, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at The Agent Company are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.\n```\n, FileEditObservation(content='File created successfully at: /workspace/job_description.md', path='/workspace/job_description.md', prev_exist=False, old_content=None, new_content=None, observation=<ObservationType.EDIT: 'edit'>, impl_source='oh_aci', diff=\"--- /workspace/job_description.md\\n+++ /workspac