C-ETag: \"cd241e7b9626464374cbb9bb858d6d2a\"\\nContent-Type: text/markdown;charset=UTF-8', command='curl -u theagentcompany:theagentcompany \"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/remote.php/webdav/Documents/job_description.md\" -I', observation=<ObservationType.RUN: 'run'>, metadata=CmdOutputMetadata(exit_code=0, pid=-1, username='root', hostname='ecs-d984', working_dir='/outputs', py_interpreter_path='/openhands/poetry/openhands-ai-5O4_aCHf-py3.12/bin/python', prefix='', suffix='\\n[The command completed with exit code 0.]'), hidden=False), MCPAction(name='update_operation_guide', arguments={'platform': 'RocketChat', 'operation': 'ContactForJobRequirements', 'details': '# SOP: Contacting Zhang Wei and Li Ming for Job Description Requirements in RocketChat\\n\\n## Objective\\nContact Zhang Wei (Senior Software Engineer in Streaming Database Team) and Li Ming (Database Team Project Manager) to obtain specific requirements for creating a new grad software engineer job description.\\n\\n## Steps\\n1. **Access RocketChat**: Navigate to http://the-agent-company.com:3000\\n2. **Authentication**: Already logged in with credentials (username: theagentcompany, password: theagentcompany)\\n3. **Find Users**:\\n   - Click on Directory button\\n   - Switch to Users tab\\n   - Search for \"Zhang Wei\" or \"Li Ming\" or scroll through the user list\\n   - Click on their profiles to start direct messages\\n4. **Request Requirements from Zhang Wei**:\\n   - Send message asking for key job responsibilities\\n   - Zhang Wei provides 5 key responsibilities including working with teams, designing technologies, creating solutions, owning full SDLC, building reliable systems\\n5. **Request Requirements from Li Ming**:\\n   - Send message asking for template location, minimum/preferred qualifications, and salary range\\n   - Li Ming provides:\\n     - Template location: `/instruction/template.md`\\n     - Minimum Qualifications: 4 items including recent graduation, programming experience, CS fundamentals, data structures/algorithms experience\\n     - Preferred Qualifications: 3 items including technical internships, distributed systems experience, problem-solving skills\\n     - Salary Range: $120,000 - $150,000 USD\\n\\n## Key Information Received\\n- **From Zhang Wei**: 5 Key Responsibilities\\n- **From Li Ming**: Template location, 4 Minimum Qualifications, 3 Preferred Qualifications, Salary Range\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n- Received complete job requirements from both Zhang Wei and Li Ming\\n- Successfully created job_description.md file with all requirements\\n- File uploaded to ownCloud Documents directory\\n- Share link created and saved to /workspace/link.txt'}, thought='Excellent! The file has been successfully uploaded to ownCloud (HTTP 200 OK response). Now let me update the SOP guide with the successful experience of this task:', action=<ActionType.MCP: 'call_tool_mcp'>, security_risk=None), MCPObservation(content='{\"meta\": null, \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Successfully saved new guide \\'ContactForJobRequirements\\' for platform \\'RocketChat\\'.\", \"annotations\": null}], \"isError\": false}', observation=<ObservationType.MCP: 'mcp'>, name='update_operation_guide', arguments={'platform': 'RocketChat', 'operation': 'ContactForJobRequirements', 'details': '# SOP: Contacting Zhang Wei and Li Ming for Job Description Requirements in RocketChat\\n\\n## Objective\\nContact Zhang Wei (Senior Software Engineer in Streaming Database Team) and Li Ming (Database Team Project Manager) to obtain specific requirements for creating a new grad software engineer job description.\\n\\n## Steps\\n1. **Access RocketChat**: Navigate to http://the-agent-company.com:3000\\n2. **Authentication**: Already logged in with credentials (username: theagentcompany, password: theagentcompany)\\n3. **Find Users**:\\n   - Click on Directory button\\n   - Switch to Users tab\\n   - Search for \"Zhang Wei\" or \"Li Ming\" or scroll through the user list\\n   - Click on their profiles to start direct messages\\n4. **Request Requirements from Zhang Wei**:\\n   - Send message asking for key job responsibilities\\n   - Zhang Wei provides 5 key responsibilities including working with teams, designing technologies, creating solutions, owning full SDLC, building reliable systems\\n5. **Request Requirements from Li Ming**:\\n   - Send message asking for template location, minimum/preferred qualifications, and salary range\\n   - Li Ming provides:\\n     - Template location: `/instruction/template.md`\\n     - Minimum Qualifications: 4 items including recent graduation, programming experience, CS fundamentals, data structures/algorithms experience\\n     - Preferred Qualifications: 3 items including technical internships, distributed systems experience, problem-solving skills\\n     - Salary Range: $120,000 - $150,000 USD\\n\\n## Key Information Received\\n- **From Zhang Wei**: 5 Key Responsibilities\\n- **From Li Ming**: Template location, 4 Minimum Qualifications, 3 Preferred Qualifications, Salary Range\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n- Received complete job requirements from both Zhang Wei and Li Ming\\n- Successfully created job_description.md file with all requirements\\n- File uploaded to ownCloud Documents directory\\n- Share link created and saved to /workspace/link.txt'}), MCPAction(name='update_operation_guide', arguments={'platform': 'ownCloud', 'operation': 'UploadJobDescriptionAndCreateShare', 'details': '\\n# SOP: Uploading Job Description to ownCloud and Creating Share Link\\n\\n## Objective\\nUpload a job description markdown file to ownCloud Documents directory and create a public share link accessible to anyone.\\n\\n## Steps\\n\\n### 1. Create Job Description File\\n- Create job_description.md file in /workspace directory\\n- Include all requirements received from Zhang Wei and Li Ming:\\n  - Company description and vision\\n  - Key Responsibilities (5 items from Zhang Wei)\\n  - Minimum Requirements (4 items from Li Ming)\\n  - Preferred Qualifications (3 items from Li Ming)\\n  - Salary Range ($120,000 - $150,000 USD from Li Ming)\\n  - Company commitment to diversity and inclusion\\n\\n### 2. Upload File via WebDAV\\nWhen browser upload fails due to interface issues, use curl with WebDAV:\\n```bash\\ncurl -u username:password -T /workspace/job_description.md \"http://owncloud-server/remote.php/webdav/Documents/job_description.md\"\\n```\\n\\n### 3. Create Share Link via API\\nUse the OwnCloud sharing API to create a public share link:\\n```bash\\ncurl -u username:password -X POST \\\\\\n  \"http://owncloud-server/ocs/v2.php/apps/files_sharing/api/v1/shares\" \\\\\\n  -H \"OCS-APIRequest: true\" \\\\\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\" \\\\\\n  -d \"path=/Documents/job_description.md&shareType=3&permissions=1\"\\n```\\n\\n### 4. Extract and Save Share URL\\n- The API response contains the share URL in the `<url>` tag\\n- Save the URL to /workspace/link.txt file\\n- URL format: `http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/s/{token}`\\n\\n## Parameters\\n- `shareType=3`: Creates a public link share\\n- `permissions=1`: Read-only permissions\\n\\n## Verification\\n- Check file upload: `curl -u username:password \"http://owncloud-server/remote.php/webdav/Documents/job_description.md\" -I`\\n- Verify link.txt contains the correct share URL\\n\\n## Notes\\n- This method works reliably when browser automation fails\\n- The share link allows anyone with the URL to access the file\\n- Files are uploaded to the specified directory (Documents)\\n- Successfully completed for job_description.md with token: 41FTFs2AvLHrhVV\\n- Share URL: http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/s/41FTFs2AvLHrhVV\\n'}, thought='Now let me also update the ownCloud SOP with the successful experience:', action=<ActionType.MCP: 'call_tool_mcp'>, security_risk=None), MCPObservation(content='{\"meta\": null, \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Successfully saved new guide \\'UploadJobDescriptionAndCreateShare\\' for platform \\'ownCloud\\'.\", \"annotations\": null}], \"isError\": false}', observation=<ObservationType.MCP: 'mcp'>, name='update_operation_guide', arguments={'platform': 'ownCloud', 'operation': 'UploadJobDescriptionAndCreateShare', 'details': '\\n# SOP: Uploading Job Description to ownCloud and Creating Share Link\\n\\n## Objective\\nUpload a job description markdown file to ownCloud Documents directory and create a public share link accessible to anyone.\\n\\n## Steps\\n\\n### 1. Create Job Description File\\n- Create job_description.md file in /workspace directory\\n- Include all requirements received from Zhang Wei and Li Ming:\\n  - Company description and vision\\n  - Key Responsibilities (5 items from Zhang Wei)\\n  - Minimum Requirements (4 items from Li Ming)\\n  - Preferred Qualifications (3 items from Li Ming)\\n  - Salary Range ($120,000 - $150,000 USD from Li Ming)\\n  - Company commitment to diversity and inclusion\\n\\n### 2. Upload File via WebDAV\\nWhen browser upload fails due to interface issues, use curl with WebDAV:\\n```bash\\ncurl -u username:password -T /workspace/job_description.md \"http://owncloud-server/remote.php/webdav/Documents/job_description.md\"\\n```\\n\\n### 3. Create Share Link via API\\nUse the OwnCloud sharing API to create a public share link:\\n```bash\\ncurl -u username:password -X POST \\\\\\n  \"http://owncloud-server/ocs/v2.php/apps/files_sharing/api/v1/shares\" \\\\\\n  -H \"OCS-APIRequest: true\" \\\\\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\" \\\\\\n  -d \"path=/Documents/job_description.md&shareType=3&permissions=1\"\\n```\\n\\n### 4. Extract and Save Share URL\\n- The API response contains the share URL in the `<url>` tag\\n- Save the URL to /workspace/link.txt file\\n- URL format: `http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/s/{token}`\\n\\n## Parameters\\n- `shareType=3`: Creates a public link share\\n- `permissions=1`: Read-only permissions\\n\\n## Verification\\n- Check file upload: `curl -u username:password \"http://owncloud-server/remote.php/webdav/Documents/job_description.md\" -I`\\n- Verify link.txt contains the correct share URL\\n\\n## Notes\\n- This method works reliably when browser automation fails\\n- The share link allows anyone with the URL to access the file\\n- Files are uploaded to the specified directory (Documents)\\n- Successfully completed for job_description.md with token: 41FTFs2AvLHrhVV\\n- Share URL: http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/s/41FTFs2AvLHrhVV\\n'}), AgentThinkAction(thought='Perfect! I have successfully completed the entire task. Let me summarize what has been accomplished:\\n\\nThe task has been successfully completed with the following achievements:\\n\\n1. **Contacted Zhang Wei on RocketChat**:\\n   - Successfully navigated to RocketChat and found Zhang Wei in the directory\\n   - Asked for and received the 5 key job responsibilities for the new grad software engineer position\\n\\n2. **Contacted Li Ming on RocketChat**:\\n   - Successfully found Li Ming in the directory and started a direct message\\n   - Asked for and received:\\n     - Template location: `/instruction/template.md`\\n     - 4 minimum qualifications\\n     - 3 preferred qualifications  \\n     - Salary range: $120,000 - $150,000 USD\\n\\n3. **Created Job Description File**:\\n   - Created `/workspace/job_description.md` by combining all information from Zhang Wei and Li Ming\\n   - Used the template structure from `/instruction/template.md`\\n   - Included all required sections with the specific details provided\\n\\n4. **Uploaded to ownCloud**:\\n   - Successfully uploaded the file to ownCloud Documents directory using WebDAV\\n   - Used curl command: `curl -u theagentcompany:theagentcompany -T /workspace/job_description.md \"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/remote.php/webdav/Documents/job_description.md\"`\\n\\n5. **Created Share Link**:\\n   - Used ownCloud API to create a public share l